e?url=%2Ffrontend%2Fassets%2Fpexo-ai%2Fpexo-strip.png&w=640&q=75)\n\n![Pexo Icon](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2Fassets%2Fpexo-ai%2Fpexo-strip.png&w=640&q=75)\n\nAsk Pulse Ai anything about real estate\n\nYour AI companion is available 24/7 — home loans, listings, market trends\n\n![pexo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2FshadowPexocha.webp&w=1200&q=75)\n\n## Unlock the Latest in Real Estate\n\nNews, Infographics, Blogs & More! Delivered to your inbox.\n\n[![Proptech Pulse Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2Fpulse_logo_latest.png&w=1200&q=75)](#home)\n\n### Reach Out to Us\n\n* Aurum Q1, Aurum Q Parć, Thane Belapur Road, Navi Mumbai 400710, India\n* [+91 22 6911 1800](tel:+912269111800)\n* [pulse@aurumproptech.in](mailto:pulse@aurumproptech.in)\n\n### Reach Out to Us\n\n* Aurum Q1, Aurum Q Parć, Thane Belapur Road, Navi Mumbai 400710, India\n* [+91 22 6911 1800](tel:+912269111800)\n* [pulse@aurumproptech.in](mailto:pulse@aurumproptech.in)\n\n### Reach Out to Us\n\n* Aurum Q1, Aurum Q Parc, Thane Belapur Road, Navi Mumbai 400710, India\n* [+91 22 6911 1800](tel:+912269111800)\n* [pulse@aurumproptech.in](mailto:pulse@aurumproptech.in)\n\n### “Data that drives action. Insight that inspires action. Technology that empowers action.“\n\n### “Data that drives action. Insight that inspires action. Technology that empowers action.“\n\nMade with Love\n\n![Statue](/frontend/assets/aurum-kuberx/flag.webp)\n\n© PropTech Pulse 2026, All rights reserved.\n\n[Terms of Use](/pulse/terms-of-use) and [Privacy Policy](/pulse/privacy-policy)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/runwal-malabar/343428/project","title":"Runwal Malabar Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Square Yards","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Runwal developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/runwal-538-4155.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Runwal Malabar Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nRunwal Malabar is a luxury residential development by Runwal located in Malabar Hill, one of the most established premium residential neighbourhoods in Mumbai. The project has been planned as a low-density high-rise tower with only around 10 residences, which sets it apart from many newer luxury developments, where inventory is much higher.\n\nThe residences come in large-format 3, 5 BHK configurations, with layouts extending from 2400 Sq.Ft. to 4900 Sq.Ft.. The homes have private elevator access, full-floor style planning, panoramic sea views, and oversized deck areas connected to the living spaces. The project is currently in the New Launch stage, and the possession is expected around Jun 2032.\n\nRunwal Malabar is a luxury residential development by Runwal located in Malabar Hill, one of the most established premium residential neighbourhoods in Mumbai. The project has been planned as a low-density high-rise tower with only around 10 residences, which sets it apart from many newer luxury developments, where inventory is much higher.\n\nThe residences come in large-format 3, 5 BHK configurations, with layouts extending from 2400 Sq.Ft. to 4900 Sq.Ft.. The homes have private elevator access, full-floor style planning, panoramic sea views, and oversized deck areas connected to the living spaces. The project is currently in the New Launch stage, and the possession is expected around Jun 2032.\n\n![Runwal Malabar Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-malabar-project-project-large-image1-4430-opt-cd88b345-8986-4300-acd4-05348dd133fc.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Runwal Malabar Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-malabar-project-amenities-features1-4199-opt-91339d7a-1e18-4a94-b5f3-4e330f957f4a.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Runwal Malabar Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-malabar-project-amenities-features4-6023-opt-6896f3a8-0d12-4332-b2be-d58b8ad34456.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Runwal Malabar Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-runwal-malabar-project-flagship-opt-61db22c2-f776-4f06-8064-f7793ba0ee0b.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹26.49 Cr - 60.00 Cr**\n\n₹1,16,400 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Runwal Malabar?\n\n## About Runwal Malabar, Malabar Hill by Runwal\n\nLuxury projects in South Mumbai are often sold through location alone. Malabar Hill already carries that premium positioning due to its limited inventory, sea-facing surroundings, and long-standing residential demand from high-net-worth buyers.\n\nRunwal Malabar, however, is not trying to function like a conventional luxury tower with a large number of apartments stacked across multiple floors. The project has been designed with only around 10 residences in total, creating a much more private residential setup compared to several newer ultra-luxury developments in Mumbai.\n\nThe project is located at Malabar Hill Mumbai in Malabar Hill and offers 3, 5 BHK Flats residences. Apartment sizes range between 2400 Sq.Ft. and 4900 Sq.Ft.. One of the strongest parts of the project is the way the homes are planned around external openness. The project focuses on:\n\n* Arabian Sea views\n* Large deck-style balconies\n* Full-floor privacy concepts\n* Private elevator and parking access\n\nThat changes the overall residential experience because common-area crowding remains extremely limited. Another detail that stands out is the scale of the layouts themselves. Several residences have been designed more like private sky residences than standard apartment units.\n\nRunwal brings around 41 years of real estate experience and has delivered 148 developments across multiple markets.\n\nLuxury projects in South Mumbai are often sold through location alone. Malabar Hill already carries that premium positioning due to its limited inventory, sea-facing surroundings, and long-standing residential demand from high-net-worth buyers.\n\nRunwal Malabar, however, is not trying to function like a conventional luxury tower with a large number of apartments stacked across multiple floors. The project has been designed with only around 10 residences in total, creating a much more private residential setup compared to several newer ultra-luxury developments in Mumbai.\n\nThe project is located at Malabar Hill Mumbai in Malabar Hill and offers 3, 5 BHK Flats residences. Apartment sizes range between 2400 Sq.Ft. and 4900 Sq.Ft.. One of the strongest parts of the project is the way the homes are planned around external openness. The project focuses on:\n\nArabian Sea views\n\nLarge deck-style balconies\n\nFull-floor privacy concepts\n\nPrivate elevator and parking access\n\nThat changes the overall residential experience because common-area crowding remains extremely limited. Another detail that stands out is the scale of the layouts themselves. Several residences have been designed more like private sky residences than standard apartment units.\n\nRunwal brings around 41 years of real estate experience and has delivered 148 developments across multiple markets.\n\n## Runwal Malabar Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Runwal Malabar.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  2400 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 26.49 Cr** | Get Payment Plan |\n| 5 BHK Apartment  4900 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 60.00 Cr** | Get Payment Plan |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nRunwal Malabar's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malabar Hill.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Runwal Malabar | Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 116400 | 80650 |\n| Mar 2026 | 98650 | 95700 |\n| Dec 2025 | 0 | 92350 |\n| Sep 2025 | 0 | 76750 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nRunwal Malabar avg. price is ₹ 1.2 L/Sq.Ft. compared to Malabar Hill at ₹ 80.7 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Lodha Seaview](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-seaview/100027/project \"Lodha Seaview\") | ₹ 1.16 L |\n| Current Project **Runwal Malabar** | ₹ 1.16 L |\n| [Runwal The Residence](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/runwal-the-residence/6610/project \"Runwal The Residence\") | ₹ 1.02 L |\n| Malabar Hill | ₹ 80,650 |\n| [JSW Echjay House](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/jsw-echjay-house/325703/project \"JSW Echjay House\") | ₹ 70,800 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Malabar Hill ranges from ₹ 97.1 K to ₹ 4.9 L with options available for 1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Runwal Malabar | In Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 97.1 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 2 L |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 3.8 L |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 4.9 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Runwal Malabar.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Runwal Malabar moved from ₹ 98,650/sqft to ₹ 116,400/sqft, reflecting a 17.99% rise.\n\n## Runwal Malabar Floor Plans\n\nThe layouts at Runwal Malabar do not follow compact high-rise apartment planning. The homes appear designed around openness, frontage, and uninterrupted external views. The project offers 3, 5 BHK Flats residences ranging between 2400 Sq.Ft. and 4900 Sq.Ft..\n\nOne noticeable aspect of the layouts is the proportions of the living spaces. The larger layouts also appear planned to maximise outward-facing exposure to the sea, rather than limiting external openings to smaller balconies. Some of the key features include:\n\n* Large deck-connected living spaces\n* Private floor elevator and parking\n* Wider sea-facing frontage\n* Better separation between private and common sections\n* Full-floor style residential feel\n* Large-format luxury apartment layouts\n\nThe layouts seem clearly targeted at end-use luxury buyers rather than at investor-focused compact inventory.\n\nThe layouts at Runwal Malabar do not follow compact high-rise apartment planning. The homes appear designed around openness, frontage, and uninterrupted external views. The project offers 3, 5 BHK Flats residences ranging between 2400 Sq.Ft. and 4900 Sq.Ft..\n\nOne noticeable aspect of the layouts is the proportions of the living spaces. The larger layouts also appear planned to maximise outward-facing exposure to the sea, rather than limiting external openings to smaller balconies. Some of the key features include:\n\nLarge deck-connected living spaces\n\nPrivate floor elevator and parking\n\nWider sea-facing frontage\n\nBetter separation between private and common sections\n\nFull-floor style residential feel\n\nLarge-format luxury apartment layouts\n\nThe layouts seem clearly targeted at end-use luxury buyers rather than at investor-focused compact inventory.\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 3 BHK 2400 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Runwal Malabar, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 26.49 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 5 BHK 4900 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Runwal Malabar, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 60.00 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Runwal Malabar\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Runwal Malabar to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Runwal Malabar Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-malabar-project-amenities-features1-4199-opt-91339d7a-1e18-4a94-b5f3-4e330f957f4a.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Runwal Malabar Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-malabar-project-amenities-features4-6023-opt-6896f3a8-0d12-4332-b2be-d58b8ad34456.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Runwal Malabar Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-runwal-malabar-project-flagship-opt-61db22c2-f776-4f06-8064-f7793ba0ee0b.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nDownload master plan of Runwal Malabar to explore layout details in Malabar Hill, Mumbai.\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Runwal Malabar\n\nAmenities at Runwal Malabar appear designed around private luxury usage rather than oversized township-style infrastructure. Since the project itself has only around 10 residences, the common facilities are expected to remain comparatively less crowded during regular usage.\n\nHere are some of the key amenities offered:\n\n* Infinity-edge swimming pool\n* Double-height clubhouse\n* Private floor parking\n* Sky lounge spaces\n* Fitness centre\n* Landscaped leisure sections\n* Wellness spaces\n* Indoor recreation areas\n* Premium lobby infrastructure\n* Multi-layer security systems\n* 270° sky lounge views\n\nThe project also places strong emphasis on the arrival experience, private access, and sea-facing common spaces, rather than relying solely on indoor clubhouse infrastructure.\n\nAmenities at Runwal Malabar appear designed around private luxury usage rather than oversized township-style infrastructure. Since the project itself has only around 10 residences, the common facilities are expected to remain comparatively less crowded during regular usage.\n\nHere are some of the key amenities offered:\n\nInfinity-edge swimming pool\n\nDouble-height clubhouse\n\nPrivate floor parking\n\nSky lounge spaces\n\nFitness centre\n\nLandscaped leisure sections\n\nWellness spaces\n\nIndoor recreation areas\n\nPremium lobby infrastructure\n\nMulti-layer security systems\n\n270° sky lounge views\n\nThe project also places strong emphasis on the arrival experience, private access, and sea-facing common spaces, rather