 infrastructure across South Mumbai.\n\nRunwal Malabar is located at Malabar Hill Mumbai in Malabar Hill, one of South Mumbai’s best-known premium residential neighbourhoods.\n\nUnlike several emerging luxury markets that still depend heavily on future infrastructure, Malabar Hill already functions as a mature urban residential zone with established social and commercial infrastructure nearby.\n\nThe project connects through Eastern Express Highway, Lamington Road and allows travel towards:\n\nMarine Drive\n\nPedder Road\n\nNariman Point\n\nBreach Candy\n\nSouth Mumbai business districts\n\nOne of the biggest advantages of this location is that residents continue to have central Mumbai connectivity while remaining in a comparatively quieter residential neighbourhood.\n\nNearby conveniences include:\n\n**Schools:** Manav Mandir High School, NRP Sheth Multipurpose High School, Walsingham House School, Gopi Birla Memorial School, Sava Sadan Society School\n\n**Supermarkets:**\n\n**Banks:** Syndicate Bank, Sbi Bank, Standard Chartered Bank, ICICI Bank, Central Bankof India?\n\nThe surrounding area also includes premium hospitals, luxury retail stores, restaurants, and long-established residential infrastructure across South Mumbai.\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai South](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Runwal Malabar.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Runwal Malabar](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-malabar-project-project-large-image1-4430-opt-cd88b345-8986-4300-acd4-05348dd133fc.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Manav Mandir High School\n\n#### Malbar Hill Post Office\n\n#### St Elizabeth Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Malabar Hill\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\n![Locality rank](/assets/images/key-insights-icon/locality-rank.svg)\n\nBased on demand, livability, and activity\n\nMalabar Hill remains one of the peaceful and scenic localities in Mumbai. The abundance of lush green spaces like Hanging Gardens and Kamala Nehru Park, combined with stunning views of the Arabian Sea, offers a serene escape from the city's fast pace. The roads are well-maintained, street lighting is good, and the neighborhood feels safe even late at night. Access to top-tier schools, premier healthcare facilities, and South Mumbai's key business hubs makes living here incredibly convenient and comfortable.\n\n— SOURABH, Owner\n\n## RERA Details of Runwal Malabar\n\nRunwal Malabar is registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1170002502441. The project is currently in the New Launch stage. The possession is expected around Jun 2032. The launch took place around Feb 2026.\n\nBefore booking, buyers should still verify:\n\n* Carpet area details\n* Sea-facing unit positioning\n* Payment schedules\n* Tower approvals\n\nRunwal Malabar is registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1170002502441. The project is currently in the New Launch stage. The possession is expected around Jun 2032. The launch took place around Feb 2026.\n\nBefore booking, buyers should still verify:\n\nCarpet area details\n\nSea-facing unit positioning\n\nPayment schedules\n\nTower approvals\n\n## How does Runwal Malabar compare with similar projects?\n\n![Runwal Malabar project in Malabar Hill, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-runwal-malabar-project-flagship-opt-61db22c2-f776-4f06-8064-f7793ba0ee0b.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Runwal Malabar](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/runwal-malabar/343428/project \"Runwal Malabar\")\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Runwal The Residence project in Malabar Hill, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.c